cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use sIfA in published work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "sIfA Tool — Statement of Intellectual Fellowship and Accountability"
abstract: >-
  sIfA gives people creating knowledge a structured, standardised way to
  record AI interaction across every stage of knowledge creation. For research,
  this is anchored in the Contributor Role Taxonomy (CRediT) that journals
  already understand. If CRediT does not apply to your processes, you can use
  your own process and develop your own taxonomy, including for creative
  projects or practical work that benefit from AI accountability.
type: software
